n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n\n\t<div id=\"col-197811459\" class=\"col medium-6 small-11 large-4\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-3090745328\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 20px;\" dataline-height=\"m\">Takk for din henvendelse<\/h2>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-3090745328 {\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  line-height: 1.25;\n}\n@media (min-width:550px) {\n  #text-3090745328 {\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n  }\n}\n@media (min-width:850px) {\n  #text-3090745328 {\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\n  }\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"text-1274421192\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>Takk for at du kontaktet oss! Vi vil ta kontakt med deg s\u00e5 snart som mulig.<\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-1274421192 {\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n@media (min-width:550px) {\n  #text-1274421192 {\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\n  }\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\n<style>\n#col-197811459 > .col-inner {\n  padding: 30px 0px 0px 0px;\n}\n@media (min-width:550px) {\n  #col-197811459 > .col-inner {\n    padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n  }\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1486185250\" class=\"col show-for-medium hide-for-small medium-12 small-12 large-4\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"gap-1878657516\" class=\"gap-element clearfix\" style=\"display:block; height:auto;\">\n\t\t\n<style>\n#gap-1878657516 {\n  padding-top: 10px;\n}\n@media (min-width:850px) {\n  #gap-1878657516 {\n    padding-top: 30px;\n  }\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n\n\t<div id=\"col-648510333\" class=\"col medium-6 small-11 large-4\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-1600110605\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 20px;\" data-line-height=\"m\">Vielen Dank f\u00fcr Ihre Anfrage<\/h2>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-1600110605 {\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  line-height: 1.25;\n}\n@media (min-width:550px) {\n  #text-1600110605 {\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n  }\n}\n@media (min-width:850px) {\n  #text-1600110605 {\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\n  }\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"text-2452580317\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>Vielen Dank, dass Sie uns kontaktiert haben! Wir werden uns so schnell wie m\u00f6glich mit Ihnen in Verbindung setzen.\n<\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-2452580317 {\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\n<style>\n#col-648510333 > .col-inner {\n  padding: 30px 0px 60px 0px;\n}\n@media (min-width:550px) {\n  #col-648510333 > .col-inner {\n    padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n  }\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1274931264\" class=\"col show-for-medium hide-for-small medium-12 small-12 large-4\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"gap-1010916570\" class=\"gap-element clearfix\" style=\"display:block; height:auto;\">\n\t\t\n<style>\n#gap-1010916570 {\n  padding-top: 10px;\n}\n@media (min-width:850px) {\n  #gap-1010916570 {\n    padding-top: 30px;\n  }\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\n<style>\n#section_1569668235 {\n  padding-top: 0px;\n  padding-bottom: 0px;\n  background-color: #1e3464;\n}\n#section_1569668235 .ux-shape-divider--bottom svg {\n  height: 60px;\n  --divider-width: 200%;\n}\n#section_1569668235 .ux-shape-divider--bottom .ux-shape-fill {\n  fill: rgb(230, 240, 255);\n}\n@media (min-width:550px) {\n  #section_1569668235 {\n    padding-top: 30px;\n    padding-bottom: 30px;\n  }\n  #section_1569668235 .ux-shape-divider--bottom svg {\n    --divider-width: 300%;\n  }\n}\n@media (min-width:850px) {\n  #section_1569668235 {\n    padding-top: 90px;\n    padding-bottom: 90px;\n  }\n  #section_1569668235 .ux-shape-divider--bottom svg {\n    --divider-width: 150%;\n  }\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/section>\n\t\n\n\t<section class=\"section\" id=\"section_1549100224\">\n\t\t<div class=\"sectio